#: AnnotationDialog/Dialog.cpp:728
msgid ""
"<p>You have just opened the advanced search dialog; to get the most out of it, it is suggested that you read the section in the manual on <a href=\"help:/kphotoalbum/sect-general-image-searches.html\">advanced searching</a>.</p>"
"<p>This dialog is also used for typing in information about images; you can find extra tips on its usage by reading about <a href=\"help:/kphotoalbum/chp-typingIn.html\">typing in</a>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Dit is de Dialoog för de verwiederte Söök. Wenn Du weten wullt, wodennig Du em op't Best bruukst, kiek Di maal den Afsnitt <a href=\"help:/kphotoalbum/sect-general-image-searches.html\">Verwiedert Söök</a> binnen dat Handbook an.</p>"
"<p>Mit dissen Dialoog kannst Du ok Informatschonen över de Biller ingeven. Binnen den Afsnitt <a href=\"help:/kphotoalbum/chp-typingIn.html\">Ingeven</a> kannst Du anner Tipps över sien Bruuk finnen.</p>"

#. +> trunk stable
#: AnnotationDialog/Dialog.cpp:737
msgid ""
"<p>You have just opened one of the most important windows in KPhotoAlbum; it contains lots of functionality which has been optimized for fast usage.</p>"
"<p>It is strongly recommended that you take 5 minutes to read the <a href=\"help:/kphotoalbum/chp-typingIn.html\">documentation for this dialog</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Dit is een vun de wichtigste Dialogen vun KPhotoAlbum. He bargt vele Funkschonen, de op't gaue Bruken topasst sünd.</p>"
"<p>Bitte nimm Di en lütt Stoot Tiet un lees de <a href=\"help:/kphotoalbum/chp-typingIn.html\">Dokmentatschoon </a> för dissen Dialoog.</p>"

