#. +> trunk stable
#: ThumbnailView/ThumbnailDND.cpp:90
msgid ""
"<p><b>Really reorder thumbnails?</b></p>"
"<p>By dragging images around in the thumbnail viewer, you actually reorder them. This is very useful where you do not know the exact date for the images. On the other hand, if the images have valid timestamps, you should use <b>Images -&gt; Sort Selected By Date and Time</b>.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Vöransichten redig nieg anornen?</b></p>"
"<p>Mit dat Dregen vun Biller binnen den Vöransichten-Kieker sorteerst Du se nieg. Dat is denn goot, wenn Du de naue Tiet vun de Biller nich weetst. Man wenn de Biller gellen Tietmarken hebbt, bruukt man lever <b>Biller -&gt; Utsöchte na Datum un Tiet sorteren</b>.</p>"

#. +> trunk stable
#: ThumbnailView/ThumbnailDND.cpp:96
msgid "Reorder Thumbnails"
msgstr "Vöransichten nieg anornen"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:2
msgid ""
"<p>On KPhotoAlbum's home page (http://www.kphotoalbum.org/) you may see a few videos featuring a number of\n"
"different KPhotoAlbum features.</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Op de Tohuussiet vun KPhotoAlbum (http://www.kphotoalbum.org/) gifft dat Videos,\n"
"de en Reeg vun KPhotoAlbum sien Funkschonen dorstellt.</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:9
msgid ""
"<p>It is possible to create new categories - that are alternatives\n"
"to <b>People</b>, <b>Places</b>, and <b>Events</b> - in the annotation\n"
"dialog. \n"
"To add new categories or remove existing ones, go to the <b>Settings-&gt;Configure KPhotoAlbum</b> dialog, and choose\n"
"<b>Categories</b> in the side bar.</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst ok niege Kategorien opstellen, wenn Di <b>Lüüd</b>,\n"
"<b>Öörd</b> un <b>Begeefnissen</b> nich langt. Maak eenfach den Dialoog\n"
"<b>Instellen -&gt; KPhotoAlbum instellen</b> op, dor kannst Du Dien egen Kategorien tofögen oder ok vörhannen wegdoon.</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:19
msgid ""
"<p>You may rename or delete a person, location, keyword or similar by\n"
"right-clicking on the item in the image property dialog.</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst en Persoon, Oort, Slötelwoort oder liek ümnömen oder\n"
"wegdoon, wenn Du binnen den Bildegenschappen-Dialoog mit den rechten\n"
"Muusknoop op den Indrag klickst.</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:26
msgid ""
"<p>When generating HTML you must specify a base directory for\n"
"the images. Here you can specify any <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kioslave/index.html\">protocol</a> supported by KDE, like ftp or\n"
"fish.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>Examples:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  "
"<li> ftp://someserver/my-upload-area/images (upload using FTP)\n"
"  "
"<li> fish://someserver/home/foo/images (upload using ssh)\n"
"  "
"<li> smb://someserver/c/images (upload to a Windows share)\n"
"</ul>"
"\n"
"</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn Du HTML opstellst, muttst Du en Wörtelorner för de Biller\n"
"angeven. Hier kannst Di all <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kioslave/index.html\">Protokollen</a> bruken, de KDE ünnerstütt,\n"
"as \"ftp\" oder \"fish\".</p>"
"\n"
"<p>Bispelen:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  "
"<li> ftp://enserver/mien-hoochlaad-rebeet/biller (Hoochladen mit FTP)\n"
"  "
"<li> fish://enserver/home/bispeel/biller (Hoochladen mit SSH)\n"
"  "
"<li> smb://enserver/c/biller (Hoochladen na en Windows-Freegaav)\n"
"</ul>"
"\n"
"</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:42
msgid ""
"<p>When you bring new images to your collection, you might not have time\n"
"right away to categorize them (i.e. specify People, Places,\n"
"etc.). Therefore, you might later want to find those images which have not\n"
"yet been categorized. Here is what I do.</p>"
" \n"
"<p>I use the <b>keyword</b> <b>OK</b>, which I set on images, once I've\n"
"categorized them (i.e. just like you may have a keyword for <b>Summer\n"
"Party</b> or <b>Interrail trip 1990</b>, you now have a keyword\n"
"<b>OK</b>). To find uncategorized images, I choose the\n"
"<b>Search</b> item from the browser, and in the keywords field, I\n"
"type <b>!OK</b>. This will find all images which do <b>not</b> have the\n"
"<b>OK</b> item.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn Du Dien Sammeln niege Biller toföögst, hest Du villicht nich jümmers\n"
"de Tiet, dat Du se direktemang na de Kategorien (Personen, Öörd, usw.) toornen\n"
"kannst. Wenn ik later de Biller, de noch na keen Kategorie toornt sünd, finnen\n"
"will, maak ik dat so:</p>"
"\n"
"<p>Wenn ik en Bild fardig na de Kategorien toornt heff, kriggt dat noch dat\n"
"<b>Slötelwoort</b> <i>OK</i>. Nu kann ik de Biller ahn Kategorie finnen, wenn\n"
"ik binnen de <b>Söök</b> vun den Kieker <b>!OK</b> na't Slötelwoort-Feld\n"
"ingiff. Disse Söök findt all Biller, de <b>nich</b> dat Slötelwoort <i>OK</i> hebbt.\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:58
msgid ""
"<p>You can reorder images on your hard disk after having loaded them into\n"
"KPhotoAlbum - KPhotoAlbum will still remember them, as it calculates checksums for\n"
"the images.</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst Dien Biller ok nieg op de Fastplaat anornen, na dat Du se\n"
"na KPhotoAlbum toföögt hest - KPhotoAlbum warrt se wedder kennen, wiel\n"
"dat Pröövsummen för de Biller utreekt.</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:66
msgid ""
"<p>If you like KPhotoAlbum, and it adds value to your daily life, please\n"
"consider donating money to the KPhotoAlbum developer as a courtesy. See\n"
"http://www.kphotoalbum.org/support.htm.\n"
"</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Wenn Du KPhotoAlbum magst un sik dat för Dien Saken bruken lett,\n"
"överlegg doch maal, wat Du em sien Schriever as Deenst nich wat Geld\n"
"tostüern wullt. Kiek op http://www.kphotoalbum.org/support.htm, wenn Du\n"
"mehr weten wullt.</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:75
msgid ""
"<p>It's possible to associate images with categories. That way when browsing, say people, you\n"
"may get a small icon for each person with e.g. the person's face.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>To specify an icon for a person, load the person in the viewer, zoom to\n"
"the part which you want to make into an icon, and choose\n"
"<b>Show Category Editor</b>. This will bring up a dialog where you can\n"
"find the person, and set the image.\n"
"</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst ok egen Lüttbiller na de Kategorien toornen. So kunnst Du t.B.\n"
"för elk Persoon en Lüttbild mit se ehr Gesicht bruken.</p>"
"\n"
"<p>Wenn Du en Lüttbild na Persoon towiesen wullt, maak en Bild vun ehr mit\n"
"den Kieker op un maak den Deel grötter, den Du as Lüttbild bruken wullt. Mit\n"
"<b>Kategorie-Editor wiesen</b> maakst Du denn en Dialoog op, binnen den Du\n"
"de Persoon finnen un dat Bild towiesen kannst.\n"
"</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:87
msgid ""
"<p>You may close the image annotation dialog (the one where you specify\n"
"people, places, etc. for the images) by pressing Ctrl+Enter.\n"
"</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst den Dialoog för't Towiesen vun Kategorien mit Strg+Ingaavtast tomaken.\n"
"</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:95
msgid ""
"<p>KPhotoAlbum has a mailing list at\n"
"http://klaralvdalens-datakonsult.se/mailman/listinfo/kphotoalbum, and an IRC\n"
"channel named <b>#kphotoalbum</b> on <b>irc.kde.org</b>.</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>KPhotoAlbum hett en Nettpostlist ünner\n"
"http://klaralvdalens-datakonsult.se/mailman/listinfo/kphotoalbum un en Klöönkanaal mit den Naam <b>#kphotoalbum</b> op <b>irc.kde.org</b>.</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:103
msgid ""
"<p>You may reorder images by dragging and dropping one image onto\n"
"another. If you drop it on the left edge, it will end up in front of\n"
"the other, if you drop it on the right edge it will be inserted behind.</p>"
"\n"
"<p align=\"right\">-- Tip contributed by Eivind Kjorstad</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du kannst de Biller mit Dregen un Droppen nieg anornen. Wenn Du en\n"
"Bild över de linke Kant vun en anner Bild droppen lettst, warrt dat dor vör\n"
"inreegt, lettst Du dat över de rechte Kant loos, landt dat dor achter.</p>"
"\n"
"<p align=\"right\">-- Tipp bidragen vun Eivind Kjorstad</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:112
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"On the thumbnail view, you can resize the grid to your needs just by clicking \n"
"the middle mouse button and dragging around. On most systems you can emulate \n"
"the middle mouse button by left and right clicking at the same time. \n"
"</p>"
"\n"
"<p align=\"right\">-- Tip contributed by Rafael Beccar</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"In de Vöransichtbild-Ansicht kannst Du dat Gadder topassen, wenn Du mit den Middelmuusknoop klickst un de Muus denn treckst. Op de mehrsten Systemen lett sik en Middelknoopklick namaken, wenn Een den linken un den rechten Muusknoop to de sülve Tiet drückt.\n"
"</p>"
"\n"
"<p align=\"right\">-- Tipp bidragen vun Rafael Beccar</p>"
"\n"

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk
#: tips:123
msgid ""
"<p>You can rate images using the numbers from 0 to 5 on the keyboard whilst in\n"
"thumbnail view or the image viewer. In the annotation dialog, you can rate\n"
"images by selecting the appropriate star rating.</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. i18n: ectx: @info:tipoftheday
#. +> trunk stable
#: tips:131
msgid ""
"<p>This is the last tip. If you know any additional tips or tricks, then please\n"
"send an email to <a href=\"mailto:blackie@kde.org\">blackie@kde.org</a>.</p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Dit is de lest Tipp. Wenn Du noch anner Knepen oder Dreihs weetst, stüer bitte <a href=\"mailto:blackie@kde.org\">blackie@kde.org</a> en Nettbreef to.</p>"
"\n"

